Fork notice
-----------

This repository (https://github.com/xcrong/docx-editor) is a community-maintained
fork of the upstream docx-editor project. It continues maintenance of the codebase
and republishes the packages under the `@xcrong` npm scope:

  - @xcrong/docx-editor-core
  - @xcrong/docx-editor-react
  - @xcrong/docx-editor-vue
  - @xcrong/docx-editor-agents
  - @xcrong/docx-editor-i18n
  - @xcrong/nuxt-docx-editor

The public API is unchanged from the upstream release this fork is based on. The
original `@eigenpal/*` npm packages have been deprecated upstream; `@xcrong/*`
exists so downstream users keep a controlled, maintained release line.

Original copyright, author, and attribution notices from the upstream source are
retained in full (see the [LICENSE](./LICENSE) file). Modified files are
identifiable via the project's version-control history.


